title: "Omnipolar-EGMs-in-staggered-arrangement-of-electrodes"
abstract: >-
  Simulation data and a minimal Python code example accompanying the study on
  staggered high-density multielectrode arrangements for omnipolar electrogram
  (oEGM) sensing in cardiac electrophysiology.
